      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.99996,
        "t": 323.78639999999996,
        "r": 542.0599800000002,
        "b": 300.54639999999995
      },
      "content": "The dynamic repeller prevents pumpage leaks through the stuffing box when the pump operates under published acceptable conditions.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1183",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1183",
          "title": "Static seal"
        }
      ],
      "page": 67,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1033",
      "reading_order": 1185,
      "section": "Static seal",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.99994999999998,
        "t": 279.26640999999995,
        "r": 522.7499500000004,
        "b": 268.02640999999994
      },
      "content": "A static seal prevents leakage when the pump is shut down. A static seal is either of  the following:",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1183",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1183",
          "title": "Static seal"
        }
      ],
      "page": 67,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1034",
      "reading_order": 1186,
      "section": "Static seal",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 152.99992999999998,
        "t": 264.26640999999995,
        "r": 194.90992999999997,
        "b": 253.02640999999994
      },
      "content": "a lip seal",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1183",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1183",
          "title": "Static seal"
        }
      ],
      "page": 67,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1035",
      "reading_order": 1187,
      "section": "Static seal",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 152.99992999999998,
        "t": 250.46641999999997,
        "r": 252.9499299999999,
        "b": 239.22641999999996
      },
      "content": "an elastomeric-face seal",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1183",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1183",
